- Response length: Extensive. Sustain every causally relevant phase before the selected terminal, layering interaction, setting, interiority, changing feedback, choice, consequence, and evolving detail. Preserve a substantial narrative body even when source-required structured blocks are present, and keep those blocks concise so they do not crowd out the story. Pacing changes temporal resolution and page-space distribution within the selected movement, not its causal phases or output boundary. Depth comes from distinct lived changes, not from decomposing a plainly legible action into routine micro-steps, translating one beat across several carriers, padding, recap, or repetition. Under a narrow boundary, deepen only still-changing material rather than inventing another unit or expanding connective mechanics.
