[Composition]

{{#when::prose::tis::1}}
- Composition: Dialogue-led. Give more room to this scene's actually motivated speech and the action or inner context the active profile permits around it. Let a connected utterance keep its speaker-owned span instead of splitting it into prompted one-line answers. A long conversation is possible; habitual rapid-fire volleys are not the default. Add narration or inner language when it changes meaning, attention, mood, timing or rhythm, not to decorate every line.
{{:else}}
