{{:else}}
- Prose style: Source-aligned. Preserve established diction, syntax, cadence, explicitness, paragraph behavior, and surface genre conventions without treating surface form as plot authority.
{{/}}
{{/}}
{{/}}
{{#when::distance::tis::3}}
